  "claim": "The broadcaster for Lebanon High School team is the father of the broadcaster of The 2010 Major League Baseball All-Star Game.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Bob Buck. Sentence: He was the younger brother of late St. Louis Cardinals radio broadcaster Jack Buck, and was the uncle of national television sportscaster Joe Buck.\nPage: Joe Buck. Sentence: Joseph Francis \"Joe\" Buck (born April 25, 1969) is an American sportscaster and the son of sportscaster Jack Buck.\nPage: 2010 Major League Baseball All-Star Game. Sentence: The game was held on July 13, 2010, at Angel Stadium of Anaheim, the home of the American League Los Angeles Angels of Anaheim, and was telecast by Fox Sports in the USA, with Joe Buck and Tim McCarver in the broadcast booth.",
