        "original_id": "44e2f91b-e0b1-58bf-9dde-e1f83c1c0096",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bob Buck, Jack Buck, Joe Buck, Tim McCarver\n- Organizations: St. Louis Cardinals, Fox Sports, Los Angeles Angels of Anaheim\n- Events: 2010 Major League Baseball All-Star Game\n- Places: Angel Stadium of Anaheim\n- Roles: radio broadcaster, sportscaster\n\nFacts:\n- Bob Buck was the younger brother of late St. Louis Cardinals radio broadcaster Jack Buck.\n- Joe Buck was born on April 25, 1969.\n- Joe Buck is an American sportscaster and the son of sportscaster Jack Buck.\n- Bob Buck was the uncle of national television sportscaster Joe Buck.\n- The 2010 Major League Baseball All-Star Game was held on July 13, 2010, at Angel Stadium of Anaheim, the home of the American League Los Angeles Angels of Anaheim.\n- Fox Sports televised the 2010 Major League Baseball All-Star Game in the United States.\n- Joe Buck and Tim McCarver worked in the broadcast booth for the 2010 Major League Baseball All-Star Game.",
